{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日ありましたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロザリオ立候補しましたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また二幕には出れませんでしたっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうなったら選ばれるまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の技が認めてもらえるまでいるっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これで千秋楽まで出なかったらそれはそれで伝説だぜっっっっヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと最近自分を出そうとすると意地でも出さない自分がいる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつからだろうか〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか前も書いたかこんなこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はどの役に立候補しようかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/06/04/5907123/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二幕に出れない代わりにライブでは自分にとっては恥ずかしすぎる髪型をするのさ。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこれ見て笑ってね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/06/04/5907123/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も頑張るか〜！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！⭐︎"}],"source":"archive"}